# NestJS + Serverless Framework 4

| Tool | Role |
|---|---|
| **NestJS** | App framework per domain (required by brief) |
| **Serverless Framework 4** | Creates **the** API Gateway + Lambdas (root `serverless.ts`) |

```
serverless.ts                 # ONLY HTTP API definition
services/products/src/lambda.ts   # Nest + serverless-express handler
services/customers/...
services/deliveries/...
services/transactions/...
```

Do not add `services/gateway` or any Express orchestrator — routing is API Gateway path → Lambda.

```typescript
// ✅ Lambda bootstrap
const app = await NestFactory.create(AppModule, new ExpressAdapter(expressApp));
app.setGlobalPrefix(process.env.SERVICE_PREFIX!);
await app.init();
return serverlessExpress({ app: expressApp });
```
